[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-olubi-amp-sarah-johnson-osj-foundation-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-236":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},236,"olubi-amp-sarah-johnson-osj-foundation-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-236","Olubi &amp; Sarah Johnson (osj) Foundation Scholarship 2026: Fully Funded","\u003Cp>The Olubi &amp; Sarah Johnson Foundation is offering you a golden, fully funded scholarships for the whole period of your studies!\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The OSJ Foundation Scholarship offers fully funded undergraduate support for students pursuing STEM courses at the University of Ibadan in Nigeria.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>OSJ Foundation STEM Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Olubi &amp; Sarah Johnson Foundation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: University of Ibadan\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Sustenance Stipend\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fosj-foundation-scholarship-stem\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>Books\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> Expenses\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: Not Specified\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Olubi &amp; Sarah Johnson Foundation STEM Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Olubi &amp; Sarah Johnson Foundation is pleased to announce a full scholarship for deserving undergraduate students who have been offered admission to study a \u003Cstrong>STEM\u003C\u002Fstrong> course at the \u003Cstrong>University of Ibadan, Ibadan, Oyo State, Nigeria\u003C\u002Fstrong>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The foundation believes that every student, regardless of their background, deserves access to quality education.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This scholarship is our commitment to ensuring that financial hardship does not stand between a brilliant young mind and their divine destiny.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Foundation provides scholarships to gifted and\u002For underprivileged students from disadvantaged families and communities, ensuring that every deserving child has access to education irrespective of their social background.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>OSJ Foundation STEM Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>OSJ Foundation STEM Scholarship offers a fully funded scholarship that covers:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Assigned University Fees\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Books Support\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Sustenance Stipend\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>OSJ Foundation STEM Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate OSJ Foundation STEM Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Col>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scored \u003Cstrong>300\u003C\u002Fstrong> and above in the JAMB Unified Tertiary Matriculation Examination (UTME)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have been \u003Cstrong>offered admission\u003C\u002Fstrong> to study an undergraduate \u003Cstrong>STEM course\u003C\u002Fstrong> at the University of Ibadan\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Are \u003Cstrong>unable to fund\u003C\u002Fstrong> their education due to low income or financial hardship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Fol>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for OSJ Foundation STEM Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the OSJ Foundation STEM Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Scholarship application guide\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill the application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fosjfoundation.org\u002Fundergraduate-stem-scholarship\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fosjfoundation.org\u002Fundergraduate-stem-scholarship\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-14 16:25:31",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Folubi-amp-sarah-johnson-osj-foundation-scholarship-2026-fully-funded\u002F6a05e96b360362.21670661_screenshot 2026-05-14 162024.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Folubi-amp-sarah-johnson-osj-foundation-scholarship-2026-fully-funded\u002F6a05e96b360362.21670661_screenshot%202026-05-14%20162024.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30